{"id": "70452", "title": "乱世风雨情", "author": "未知", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 19, "available": 19, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70452/70452s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70452.htm", "intro": "一座小山上，一男一女，一老一少二人正静静地站立着。站在前面的白须老者一身素色道袍，正凝视天空若有所思。\n    老者身后却是一名妙龄少女，白皙的皮肤在一头有些异样的火红色长发映衬下更显得娇嫩无暇，未施粉黛的面孔更散发出脱俗的美感宛如下凡的仙女一般。\n    雪白的长裙覆盖住整个修长的下身，只露出一双绣花的靴子，上身同样白色的衣裳自胸口左右分开，露出了雪白的双肩了一部分红色的胸衣，与上衣完全脱离的衣袖连接着两条银白的飘带和火红的发丝一起在风中飞舞，显出惬意的美感。", "base": "files/article/html/70/70452", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一卷 风雨欲来1-2", "file": "10972326.html", "available": true}, {"title": "3-4", "file": "10972327.html", "available": true}, {"title": "5-6", "file": "10972328.html", "available": true}, {"title": "7-8", "file": "10972329.html", "available": true}, {"title": "9-10", "file": "10972330.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第二卷 帝陵之谋1-2", "file": "10972331.html", "available": true}, {"title": "3-4", "file": "10972332.html", "available": true}, {"title": "5-6", "file": "10972333.html", "available": true}, {"title": "7-8", "file": "10972334.html", "available": true}, {"title": "9-10", "file": "10972335.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第三卷 来世樱花1-2", "file": "10972336.html", "available": true}, {"title": "3-4", "file": "10972337.html", "available": true}, {"title": "5-6", "file": "10972338.html", "available": true}, {"title": "7-8", "file": "10972339.html", "available": true}, {"title": "9-10", "file": "10972340.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第四卷以退为进1-5", "file": "10972341.html", "available": true}, {"title": "6-8", "file": "10972342.html", "available": true}, {"title": "9-10", "file": "10972343.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第五卷左右逢缘", "file": "10972344.html", "available": true}]}